		"&6&lXi you cai liao"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Shou ji xi you cai liao. Ta men chong zhi he sheng ji"
		"&7ni xi you pin zhi zhuang bei de ci zhui."
		""
		"&6&l类别:&r &f材料"
		""
		"&e&l★ Ti shi:&r &7Xi you cai liao hui bian shao. Yong zai ni xiang chang qi bao liu de zhuang bei."
	]
