		"&d&lXiao yin sheng ji"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Xiao yin sheng ji jian xiao ji qi yun zhuan de sheng yin,"
		"&7dui ji di pang de gong chang shi yi zhong xiao xiao de wei ji."
		""
		"&d&l类别:&r &f升级"
		""
		"&e&l★ Ti shi:&r &7Zai ni ju zhu yu shui mian chu yong ta men tian man sheng ji cao."
