		"&7hui zhua zhu ni, jiang ni reng chu, fu shang shi zhong ji di mian."
		""
		"&c&l类别:&r &f变异首领"
		""
		"&e&l★ Ti shi:&r &7Zai ta dao xia shi zhao huo, ke da chu qiang da de zhi ming yi ji."
	]
	quest.7F641AA2D88BB457.quest_subtitle: "&7Da dao ben zhong de zhua qu zhe"
	quest.7F641AA2D88BB457.title: "&c&lBian yi sang shi"
